{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんにちわ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈子だよー٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/11/21/4318554/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のブログたくさんのコメントありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでる途中、何回も泣きそうになったよ。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"里沙子にも京ちゃんにも、ななつんにも読んでもらうように伝えておくね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は、NOGIBINGOの収録や、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ天の収録、アルバムのレコーディングや撮影などをしていました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NOGIBINGO収録前！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/11/21/4318554/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなみお"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間は、みさ先輩とらんぜと3人である仕事もさせてもらえて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても楽しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"情報が解禁されたら話すね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"